        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A SIMPLY SUPERB 4 BED / 2 BATH SEMI DETACHED FAMILY HOME WITH LARGE SOUTH FACING BACK GARDEN IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER SETTLED NEIGHBOURHOOD OF ROSELAWN IN CASTLEKNOCK DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS VERY STRONGLY RECOMMENDED.... \r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 99 Roselawn Road to the Castleknock property market. Roselawn is a highly popular neighbourhood of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nA generous driveway welcomes you to this incredible family home. No. 99 will appeal to first time buyers, investors and parties trading up / downsizing alike. This premium property has been tastefully decorated and is in walk in condition.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living room, lounge room, kitchen / dining room, and a downstairs wc / bathroom. Upstairs there is a landing, 4 bedrooms, a family bathroom and hot press.\r\n\r\nThe attractive living room is flooded with natural light and double doors open to the lounge room located at the rear. The kitchen / dining area is bright and airy. The kitchen has charming cream coloured units. It offers an abundance of worktop space and extensive storage space. The downstairs bathroom is fully tiled with a shower unit.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are four good sized double bedrooms with wardrobe space. The family bathroom boasts top quality sanitary ware. The house has top grade white coloured glazing throughout.\r\n\r\nThis fine property features a stunning sunny south facing back garden which is not overlooked. This offers the perfect place to relax and / or entertain. There is also another extended garden area at the rear (details upon request).\r\n\r\nIdeally situated tucked in the middle only minutes walk of two superb local villages both with numerous amenities namely Castleknock village and Blanchardstown village. This location is second to none within a 20 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. Also Clonsilla Clonee and Dunboyne Villages are all within close proximity. The well known Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach. Added to this there are many recreational and sports amenities literally on your doorstep. Leisure activities including National Aquatic Centre and Sports Campus Ireland are in the locality. Dublin 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. The Phoenix Park is within a 15 minute drive. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. Also access to the M50 Motorway is close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is very strongly recommended…\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
